{"articleNo":"54681","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=54681&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"kit포탈 내 카페서비스 제공 알림","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.05.03","hit":"4591","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><font color=\"#5d5d5d\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">안녕하세요,</span></span></span></span></font></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">정보전산원 포탈 담당자입니다.</span></span></span></span> </p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp; </p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><div style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #c1c1c1 1px dashed; BORDER-LEFT: #c1c1c1 1px dashed; PADDING-BOTTOM: 10px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: #eeeeee; PADDING-LEFT: 10px; PADDING-RIGHT: 10px; BORDER-TOP: #c1c1c1 1px dashed; BORDER-RIGHT: #c1c1c1 1px dashed; PADDING-TOP: 10px\" class=\"txc-textbox\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><font color=\"#ff007f\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">kit포탈 내 카페서비스가 탑재되었습니다.</span></span></span></span></span></span></strong> </font><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><strong style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><br></strong></span><font style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\" color=\"#5d5d5d\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><font color=\"#000000\"><strong>금오인이라면</strong> </font>재학생, 휴학생, 졸업생, 교수, 직원 등</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><font style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\" color=\"#5d5d5d\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\">누.구.든.지.</font></strong> 카페 개설·가입·활동이 가능하고</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#5d5d5d\"><font color=\"#000000\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">언.제.든.지.</span></span></span></strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> </span></font><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">카페 편집·탈퇴·폐쇄도 가능하며</span></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><font color=\"#5d5d5d\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">다양한 목적으로 </span></span></span></font></strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">친목도모, 정보교류, 스터디활동 등으로 활용이 가능합니다.</span></font></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></span></p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></span></div><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><img style=\"FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" alt=\"\" src=\"http://cic.kumoh.ac.kr/upload/0684718a-a6e4-4c9d-a7a4-94477acda5d6.jpg\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span sty